Subject: feature/delete-for-all-default: tick delete for everyone by default

Behind NeoOptions.DELETE_FOR_ALL_DEFAULT. Where the delete messages dialog offers to delete for the other person or for all members, the box starts ticked; it can still be unticked before deleting.
